DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45052::$$$message_0403_0000_0000$$$::"...Haaah."::
45053::$$$message_0403_0000_0001$$$::"What's the matter with this girl!? She keeps leading me on, only to say, 'I'll be shy if people gossip that we're friends!'"::
45054::$$$message_0403_0000_0002$$$::"You think you can stand beside me with that arrogance? I wouldn't want someone like you! Begone!"::
45055::$$$message_0403_0000_0003$$$::"...Oi, could you put down the video games while we're in the bath, at least?"::
45056::$$$message_0403_0000_0004$$$::"What do you mean? The onsen granted my wish and blessed me with this game console and everything I could ask for. It would be a waste not to play them."::
45057::$$$message_0403_0000_0005$$$::"Right, sure..."::
45058::$$$message_0403_0000_0006$$$::"By the way, boy. Why didn't you make a wish?"::
45059::$$$message_0403_0000_0007$$$::"I already told you! I don't have any wish to magically grow taller!"::
45060::$$$message_0403_0000_0008$$$::"But I can tell you're insecure about it."::
45061::$$$message_0403_0000_0009$$$::"I-I'm still in my growth phase! I'll get plenty taller, just you watch!"::
45062::$$$message_0403_0000_0010$$$::"Well, that would be a sight to see."::
45063::$$$message_0403_0000_0011$$$::"Hmph! Yeah... I bet by then, I'll be an archmage, and one of the top lecturers at the Clock Tower."::
45064::$$$message_0403_0000_0012$$$::"They'll call me Professor Charisma, and I'll swagger around the campus in a red coat..."::
45065::$$$message_0403_0000_0013$$$::"Why a red coat?"::
45066::$$$message_0403_0000_0014$$$::"Huh? Um... B-because your cloak is red! No other reason!"::
45067::$$$message_0403_0000_0015$$$::"I see, I see. [wvl canskip=false time=500][hffacechg2 chara=ライダー4th face=真剣 pos=winner time=300 textclear=0]I'd be cold without it, though..."::
45068::$$$message_0403_0000_0016$$$::"You've got enough muscle to keep you warm. It's only fair."::
45069::$$$message_0403_0000_0017$$$::"Hahahahaha! Also true! The mountain chill would surely seep into your twiglike body!"::
45070::$$$message_0403_0000_0018$$$::"I'm not a twig!"::
45071::$$$message_0403_0000_0019$$$::"Very well. I will allow you to use that cloak."::
45072::$$$message_0403_0000_0020$$$::"You giant arseho[line len=2]Oh, it's snowing."::
45073::$$$message_0403_0000_0021$$$::"What, snow? I retract that statement, boy. I don't like the cold. Give me back my cloak!"::
45075::$$$message_0403_0000_0023$$$::"Too bad! Warm yourself up with your video games!"::
�